	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[b]Adds a new constructible building - Kenneth's Fruit Shop (built by Robin) - with 254 custom fruits to buy![/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Customization: By default, all fruit items appear in the shop. If you prefer a smaller selection and have Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM) installed, you can disable individual fruits to remove them from the shop. Re-enabling a fruit restores it to the shop.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]More details can be found in ReadMe.txt.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Please do not reupload this mod or include it in modpacks without permission.[/b]",
